Template: stremio-server-installer/download
Type: boolean
Default: true
_Description: Download Stremio's streaming server component?
 server.js is Stremio's proprietary streaming server, which enables
 BitTorrent-based streaming in the stremio media center client. It is not
 included in this package and is not redistributed by Debian: accepting
 this prompt downloads it directly from Stremio's own servers
 (dl.strem.io), the same file used by Stremio's own official desktop
 client and by Stremio Service, subject to Stremio's terms of service
 (https://www.stremio.com/tos).
 .
 If you decline, stremio will still work, but BitTorrent-based streaming
 will be unavailable.
